('RACE_0013', 'Dragonborn (2014)', ARRAY['PHB2014', 'EGW', 'HTA']::text[], '{"Optional": {"subrace": "Optional", "sources": ["PHB2014"], "size": "M", "speed": "30", "language": "Common, Draconic", "asi": {"str": "2", "dex": null, "con": null, "int": null, "wis": null, "cha": "1"}, "extra": null, "notes_advice": "- Breath Weapon can be used as an action or as a bonus action.\n - Can have non-prehensile tails.\n - The statistics of this species can be used to represent a Half Dragon, as described in Fizban''s Treasury of Dragons as well as in the Monster Manual. If you choose to play a Half Dragon in this way, your creature type is Dragon, not Humanoid.\n - As described in the Player Guidelines, you can choose to play as a mixture of species in Allowed Content and choose one of the component species to play (e.g. a half-dwarf, half-elf and using the statistics of the Elf species). If you play a mixture of species that includes Half Dragon as described above, you can choose for your creature type to be Dragon even if you select a different species to play. For example, a half Dragonborn (Half Dragon), half Tiefling played using the statistics of the Tiefling species but with a creature type of Dragon, not Humanoid."}, "Draconblood": {"subrace": "Draconblood", "sources": ["EGW"], "size": "M", "speed": "30", "language": "Common, Draconic", "asi": {"str": null, "dex": null, "con": null, "int": "2", "wis": null, "cha": "1"}, "extra": null, "notes_advice": null}, "Ravenite": {"subrace": "Ravenite", "sources": ["EGW"], "size": "M", "speed": "30", "language": "Common, Draconic", "asi": {"str": "2", "dex": null, "con": "1", "int": null, "wis": null, "cha": null}, "extra": null, "notes_advice": null}, "Returned": {"subrace": "Returned", "sources": ["HTA"], "size": "M", "speed": "30", "language": "Common, Draconic", "asi": {"str": "1", "dex": null, "con": "1", "int": null, "wis": null, "cha": "1"}, "extra": null, "notes_advice": null}}'::jsonb, 13),
