('RACE_0002', 'RAC_0007', 'None', ARRAY['MPMM']::text[], 'S or M', '30', 'Common, +1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '- Can use the Plane-Touched Wings as a character creation option as detailed below, as based on the Season 9 Adventurer''s League Player Guide
 - As with all racial flight, flight is only enabled at character level 5+. This flight is also retained via the Ancestral Legacy trait of lineages from VRGR.
 - Plane-Touched Wings. You have feathered wings sprouting from your shoulder blades. You have a flying speed of 30 feet while not wearing heavy armor. This trait replaces the Light Bearer trait and the Celestial Revelation trait as applicable.', 6),
('RACE_0004', 'RAC_0008', 'None', ARRAY['AAG']::text[], 'M', '30', 'Common, +1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '- Can choose to benefit from Blessed of Corellon (MTF p. 45), which allows changing sex whenever finishing a long rest. 
 - Due to the nature of their trance and long-lived lives, elves raised in typical elven communities usually aren''t considered full adults in the eyes of elven society until after their first century. However, elves achieve full physical and mental maturity at the same rate as an adult human. As such, elves that become adventurers prior to the passing of their first century are atypical but not impossible.', 7),
