 - As described in the Player Guidelines, you can choose to play as a mixture of species in Allowed Content and choose one of the component species to play (e.g. a half-dwarf, half-elf and using the statistics of the Elf species). If you play a mixture of species that includes Half Dragon as described above, you can choose for your creature type to be Dragon even if you select a different species to play. For example, a half Dragonborn (Half Dragon), half Tiefling played using the statistics of the Tiefling species but with a creature type of Dragon, not Humanoid.', 173),
